    <paragraph>For the following exercises, consider triangle ABC, a right triangle with a right angle at C. a. Find the missing side of the triangle. b. Find the six trigonometric function values for the angle at A. Where necessary, simplify to a fraction or round to three decimal places.</paragraph>
